@RyanVail How have you tested this PR so far, OS and gamepads?


-------------

I tried `SDL_GetJoystickSerial` and `SDL_GetGamepadSerial`, but on macOS they return an empty string. This could also be due to the gamepad itself (it's very old).

```cpp
joypad_info["serial_number"] = String(SDL_GetJoystickSerial(joy));
//joypad_info["serial_number"] = String(SDL_GetGamepadSerial(gamepad));

```


